  "question": {
    "text": "A particle performs simple harmonic motion with amplitude A. Its speed is tripled at the instant that it is at a distance <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> from equilibrium position. The new amplitude of the motion is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mn>41</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "For Original SHM,<br /><br />using &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math>&nbsp;<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />New SHM will be,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>v =&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><msqrt><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><msqrt><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>49</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
